    <string name="tutorial_home_title">欢迎使用 MycoSpec</string>
    <string name="tutorial_home_body">本应用配合专用硬件，测量荧光浓度并评估样品的霉变风险。</string>
    <string name="tutorial_project_title">组装硬件</string>
    <string name="tutorial_project_body">按图示组装硬件，并将手机放置在其上方。</string>
    <string name="tutorial_step1_title">波长校准</string>
    <string name="tutorial_step1_body">将校准套件插入样品口，使波长校准段（RGB 光源）朝向手机，然后拍摄 1–5 张图像。</string>
    <string name="tutorial_step2_title">光谱响应校准</string>
    <string name="tutorial_step2_body">将校准套件插入样品口，使光源校准段（白光）朝向手机，然后拍摄 1–5 张图像。</string>
    <string name="tutorial_step3_title">样品拍摄</string>
    <string name="tutorial_step3_body">将样品或空白插入样品口，拍摄 1–5 张图像。</string>
    <string name="tutorial_step4_title">标准曲线</string>
    <string name="tutorial_step4_body">构建标准曲线时，将每个标准品及其空白插入样品口，并输入对应浓度。</string>
